    "redaction_note": "Workspace prefixes are replaced with <WORKSPACE>; the recorded local hostname is replaced with <LOCAL_HOST>. Original measurements, hashes, equality fields, test output and other values are preserved. Publication metadata is added separately.",
    "scope": "Existing exact compile/run commands and environment for the ASan+UBSan sink component run."
  }
}
